@host = http://localhost:5088

### Sandbox status
GET {{host}}/api/mastercard/sandbox/status

### End-to-end demo: create card (MCG) → ACS register → upgrade to MWE
POST {{host}}/api/demo/e2e
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceProductCode": "MCG",
  "targetProductCode": "MWE"
}

### List product catalog
GET {{host}}/api/products

### Create a card that can be upgraded
POST {{host}}/api/cards
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productCode": "MCG",
  "lookupBin": false
}

### List cards
GET {{host}}/api/cards

### Register PAN in Product Graduation Plus
POST {{host}}/api/cards/card_REPLACE_ME/register

### Upgrade card product (same PAN)
POST {{host}}/api/cards/card_REPLACE_ME/upgrades
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetProductCode": "MWE",
  "reason": "CUSTOMER_UPGRADE"
}

### Reconcile ACS status
POST {{host}}/api/cards/card_REPLACE_ME/upgrades/mig_REPLACE_ME/reconcile

### Issuer vs ACS treatment check
GET {{host}}/api/cards/card_REPLACE_ME/treatment

### Rollback to previous product
POST {{host}}/api/cards/card_REPLACE_ME/upgrades/mig_REPLACE_ME/rollback

### Close / delete ACS registration
POST {{host}}/api/cards/card_REPLACE_ME/close

### Reconcile all open (Submitted/Unknown) migrations
POST {{host}}/api/migrations/reconcile

### Sandbox BIN lookup
POST {{host}}/api/mastercard/sandbox/bin-lookup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "panOrAccountRange": "585240844"
}
